1
00:00:04,683 --> 00:00:05,767
<font color="white">他來了啊</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:43,221 --> 00:00:44,514
<font color="white">我不會讓你逃掉的</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:48,143 --> 00:00:49,978
<font color="white">傳送功能已被鎖定</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:50,937 --> 00:00:52,939
<font color="white">啊，我都忘了</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:53,648 --> 00:00:54,983
<font color="white">可惡啊</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:57,194 --> 00:00:58,653
<font color="white">有反應了？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:08,705 --> 00:01:11,666
<font color="white">這是測試裝甲！</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:16,421
{\an8}<font color="white">我懂了，因為是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">測試裝甲才能正常使用</font></font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:16,505 --> 00:01:19,341
<font color="white">啊，對了，那個混蛋</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:55,562 --> 00:02:56,479
<font color="white">-不可能…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎麼了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:57,355 --> 00:03:00,150
<font color="white">測試裝甲被傳送出去了</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:03:00,650 --> 00:03:01,943
<font color="white">妳說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:03:05,614 --> 00:03:06,990
<font color="white">他在哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:03:15,665 --> 00:03:18,877
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,462
<font color="white">井手先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:03:20,545 --> 00:03:23,089
<font color="white">你在做什麼？立刻回來</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:03:25,926 --> 00:03:27,093
<font color="white">他被殺害了</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:29,179 --> 00:03:31,431
<font color="white">你剛才說了什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:31,514 --> 00:03:34,434
{\an8}<font color="white">我爸被殺了！</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:35,518 --> 00:03:38,521
<font color="white">早田被殺了？怎麼可能</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:38,605 --> 00:03:42,359
{\an8}<font color="white">從剛才我就一直</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">試圖與佐菲裝甲取得聯繫</font></font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:42,442 --> 00:03:44,277
<font color="white">但是至今對方仍未回應</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:44,361 --> 00:03:49,074
{\an8}<font color="white">不過也可能是裝甲故障</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">應該先確認事情真相…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:49,157 --> 00:03:51,243
<font color="white">現在沒空扯那些！</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:51,326 --> 00:03:53,203
<font color="white">對我爸痛下殺手的外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:53,286 --> 00:03:55,121
<font color="white">就在我眼前逃跑</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:55,205 --> 00:03:57,499
<font color="white">難道要叫我眼睜睜地看他溜走嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:57,582 --> 00:03:59,292
<font color="white">不對，不是這樣</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:59,376 --> 00:04:01,253
{\an8}<font color="white">諸星先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:01,336 --> 00:04:03,546
<font color="white">我們不是叫你放他一馬</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:04,547 --> 00:04:07,259
<font color="white">是要你什麼都別做</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:07,342 --> 00:04:10,387
<font color="white">你這麼做明顯是違背命令</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:13,974
{\an8}<font color="white">現在立刻給我回來</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:40,417 --> 00:04:43,962
<font color="white">真不愧是超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,216
<font color="white">你就是害死我爸的外星人嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:49,301 --> 00:04:52,679
<font color="white">那麼說不太正確</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:54,347 --> 00:04:57,309
<font color="white">純粹是因為他想拯救眾人</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:57,392 --> 00:05:00,186
<font color="white">因而遭到波及罷了</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:00,770 --> 00:05:03,398
<font color="white">明明沒人求他那麼做</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:05,150 --> 00:05:09,446
<font color="white">你爸可真是愛管閒事啊</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:25,003 --> 00:05:28,340
{\an8}<font color="white">你開什麼玩笑！</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:49,194 --> 00:05:50,153
<font color="white">（中斷連接）</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:50,236 --> 00:05:53,198
<font color="white">與超人力霸王的通訊中斷了</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:53,281 --> 00:05:55,992
<font color="white">意思是他開始交戰了？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:56,076 --> 00:05:58,703
<font color="white">那樣一來就很難強制解除了</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:58,787 --> 00:06:00,997
<font color="white">不，他已經被鎖定了</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:06:01,581 --> 00:06:02,665
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:06:03,917 --> 00:06:07,837
<font color="white">諸星、太郎，請你們盡快追上進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,381
<font color="white">收到</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:06:11,341 --> 00:06:14,135
<font color="white">那小子老愛給人添麻煩</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,263
<font color="white">我先出去了</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:06:20,558 --> 00:06:21,893
<font color="white">你怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:06:21,976 --> 00:06:24,562
<font color="white">不，什麼事也沒有</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:06:25,897 --> 00:06:27,065
<font color="white">這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:07:19,951 --> 00:07:21,286
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:07:39,679 --> 00:07:40,722
<font color="white">怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:07:43,808 --> 00:07:46,352
<font color="white">-什麼？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-他不是才剛引發事件嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:07:49,397 --> 00:07:51,733
<font color="white">小聲點，被他聽到就糟了</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:07:51,816 --> 00:07:53,234
<font color="white">好可怕啊</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:07:54,903 --> 00:07:56,654
<font color="white">看來大眾</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:07:56,738 --> 00:08:00,408
<font color="white">並未如傳聞般支持你啊</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:08:00,909 --> 00:08:02,535
<font color="white">你在說什麼…</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:08:02,619 --> 00:08:03,828
<font color="white">住口！</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:08:22,847 --> 00:08:24,349
<font color="white">給我站住！</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:08:34,859 --> 00:08:37,195
<font color="white">那麼，超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:08:37,278 --> 00:08:39,447
<font color="white">我現在要給你出個題目</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:08:41,115 --> 00:08:46,704
<font color="white">對你抱持猜忌的那些大眾</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:08:46,788 --> 00:08:49,916
<font color="white">若是身陷危機之中</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:08:49,999 --> 00:08:55,338
<font color="white">你仍然會去拯救他們嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:08:55,421 --> 00:08:59,676
<font color="white">還是會不顧他們的死活</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">繼續來追我？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:09:01,302 --> 00:09:02,554
<font color="white">這是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:07,183
<font color="white">你就二選一吧</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:09:09,602 --> 00:09:10,895
<font color="white">你打算做什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:09:23,783 --> 00:09:25,326
<font color="white">住手啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:09:41,050 --> 00:09:43,177
<font color="white">果然是有其父必有其子</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:09:44,053 --> 00:09:49,350
<font color="white">這景象簡直是重現了剛才的那幕啊</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:02,822
<font color="white">偵測到兩股高能量反應</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:10:02,905 --> 00:10:04,490
<font color="white">其中一個應該是源自超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:10:04,574 --> 00:10:07,285
<font color="white">他的能量值急遽增長</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:10:07,368 --> 00:10:09,078
<font color="white">限制器被擅自解除了</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:27,972
<font color="white">真意外啊</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:11:29,450 --> 00:11:30,701
<font color="white">那傢伙呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:53,391
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:12:08,781 --> 00:12:09,699
<font color="white">奇怪</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:12:10,825 --> 00:12:14,996
<font color="white">可能遭受外星人攻擊</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:12:15,079 --> 00:12:17,415
<font color="white">移動至室內避難</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:12:17,498 --> 00:12:21,586
<font color="white">並打開電視或收聽廣播</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:12:21,669 --> 00:12:23,296
<font color="white">這些是我…</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:35,391
<font color="white">我怎麼會做這種事？</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:12:39,729 --> 00:12:41,105
<font color="white">對了，那傢伙跑去哪了？</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:12:41,189 --> 00:12:42,064
<font color="white">不准動</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:12:45,234 --> 00:12:46,277
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:12:47,528 --> 00:12:49,989
<font color="white">-你是來幫我…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不是</font></font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,202
<font color="white">我要拘捕你</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:12:57,497 --> 00:12:59,373
<font color="white">你願意聽我解釋嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:12:59,457 --> 00:13:00,791
<font color="white">不用聽也知道</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:13:01,709 --> 00:13:03,544
<font color="white">現在的你過於危險</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:13:04,587 --> 00:13:06,380
<font color="white">你目睹父親被殺掉</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:13:07,173 --> 00:13:09,842
<font color="white">因此導致情緒失控，原因僅止於此</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:13:16,641 --> 00:13:18,809
<font color="white">請別那麼輕描淡寫地帶過</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:13:22,813 --> 00:13:26,192
<font color="white">你懂父親被殺的我有何心情嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:13:26,275 --> 00:13:27,568
<font color="white">我懂</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:13:30,988 --> 00:13:32,073
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:13:33,074 --> 00:13:34,909
<font color="white">我也曾經體會過</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:13:36,118 --> 00:13:39,789
<font color="white">那是一種異於悲傷跟憤怒</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:13:39,872 --> 00:13:43,292
<font color="white">幾乎無法用言語確切形容的情感</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:13:46,337 --> 00:13:47,922
<font color="white">我對你這麼說過對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:13:49,549 --> 00:13:52,718
<font color="white">但我們一定能揭開真相</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:13:52,802 --> 00:13:54,095
<font color="white">我相信辦得到</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:13:54,762 --> 00:13:57,640
<font color="white">你也要相信自己</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:13:59,725 --> 00:14:03,521
<font color="white">你敢堅信自己</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">現在的行為不是錯的嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:14:09,193 --> 00:14:10,570
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:14:13,990 --> 00:14:15,616
<font color="white">只能選擇這麼做</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:14:16,492 --> 00:14:18,160
<font color="white">那麼拜託你不要抵抗</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:14:18,703 --> 00:14:22,248
<font color="white">然後讓我們相信你吧</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:14:25,334 --> 00:14:27,003
<font color="white">凌晨12點38分</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:14:28,170 --> 00:14:30,298
<font color="white">成功拘捕超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:39,348
<font color="white">知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:14:56,991 --> 00:14:58,784
<font color="white">晚了一步嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:15:00,494 --> 00:15:01,787
<font color="white">是亞達德嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:15:04,874 --> 00:15:07,209
<font color="white">好，我知道</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:15:08,127 --> 00:15:12,506
<font color="white">星團評議會也將有所行動是吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:15:18,262 --> 00:15:20,389
<font color="white">要用上那個男人了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:15:36,072 --> 00:15:41,243
{\an8}<font color="white">已釐清昨晚接連發生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">由超人力霸王引發的爆破事件全貌</font></font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:15:43,579 --> 00:15:46,040
{\an8}<font color="white">所幸無人罹難</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:15:46,123 --> 00:15:48,000
{\an8}<font color="white">不過傷者眾多</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:15:48,084 --> 00:15:50,086
{\an8}<font color="white">並造成大量建築損毀</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:15:50,169 --> 00:15:55,007
{\an8}<font color="white">致力於復興一年前慘案的相關人士</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">為這起事件感到忿忿不平</font></font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:15:56,258 --> 00:16:01,806
<font color="white">另外在發生淡谷區事件</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">三小時後的晚間11點40分</font></font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:16:01,889 --> 00:16:03,683
<font color="white">距離事故現場五公里遠的地區</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:16:03,766 --> 00:16:06,477
<font color="white">別棟大樓失火</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:09,605
<font color="white">有許多民眾表示</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">在此也有目擊超人力霸王</font></font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:16:10,189 --> 00:16:12,817
<font color="white">目前警方正在調查關聯性</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:16:13,985 --> 00:16:15,361
<font color="white">大谷教授</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:16:15,444 --> 00:16:17,905
{\an8}<font color="white">這一連串的事件除了外星人的攻擊外</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:16:17,989 --> 00:16:22,034
{\an8}<font color="white">能確信超人力霸王也有助長災情惡化</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:16:22,118 --> 00:16:24,245
{\an8}<font color="white">請問您的看法如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:16:24,328 --> 00:16:27,039
<font color="white">這個嘛，我從以前</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:16:27,123 --> 00:16:31,919
<font color="white">就不斷指出超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">與社會關係產生的問題</font></font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:16:32,003 --> 00:16:33,879
<font color="white">他們之所以能夠活動</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:16:33,963 --> 00:16:38,426
<font color="white">是搭上大眾追求英雄的順風車</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:16:39,343 --> 00:16:41,220
<font color="white">而過度依賴超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:16:41,303 --> 00:16:45,641
<font color="white">這類過度強大的特定對象</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:16:45,725 --> 00:16:50,062
<font color="white">有極高可能會釀成這次的災害</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:16:51,105 --> 00:16:54,275
<font color="white">我認為現在正是社會大眾</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">理解超人力霸王可怕之處的…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:16:54,358 --> 00:16:56,694
<font color="white">超人力霸王究竟是怎麼了呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:16:57,778 --> 00:16:59,780
<font color="white">在那時候…</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:17:00,364 --> 00:17:05,411
<font color="white">出現的雖然身形小</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">但我也把他當成真正的超人力霸王</font></font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:17:06,245 --> 00:17:09,790
<font color="white">話說剛才那個某某教授也沒說錯</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:17:09,874 --> 00:17:13,127
<font color="white">超人力霸王確實造成了不小的損害</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:17:13,961 --> 00:17:15,087
<font color="white">天曉得</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:17:15,171 --> 00:17:17,381
<font color="white">你不在意超人力霸王的事情嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:17:17,465 --> 00:17:19,717
<font color="white">那不關我的事</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:21,844
<font color="white">你少在那邊發表觀眾感言</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:17:21,927 --> 00:17:23,596
<font color="white">差不多該準備前往現場了</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:27,850
<font color="white">前往現場？不就是有人闖空門嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:17:27,933 --> 00:17:31,312
<font color="white">我們被徹底排除在</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">與外星人相關的案件外了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:17:31,979 --> 00:17:34,065
<font color="white">遠藤先生，你應該也難以接受吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:17:34,148 --> 00:17:36,692
<font color="white">案件就是案件，我們走吧</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:17:36,776 --> 00:17:37,902
<font color="white">錢我放桌上了</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:17:37,985 --> 00:17:39,153
<font color="white">好的！</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:17:39,236 --> 00:17:41,489
<font color="white">別走，等等我啦</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:17:41,572 --> 00:17:42,698
<font color="white">感謝招待</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:17:42,782 --> 00:17:44,575
<font color="white">謝謝惠顧</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:17:47,453 --> 00:17:51,874
<font color="white">然而另一方面正是因為忽略了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">他們擁有強大力量的危險性</font></font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:17:51,957 --> 00:17:55,044
<font color="white">才會引來報應，讓昨晚的事發生…</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:18:00,591 --> 00:18:01,967
<font color="white">玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:18:02,718 --> 00:18:04,220
<font color="white">什麼事啦？</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:18:04,303 --> 00:18:06,764
<font color="white">妳有受邀出演電視節目，要接嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:18:06,847 --> 00:18:09,934
<font color="white">我現在沒有心情談工作的事</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:18:10,017 --> 00:18:12,019
<font color="white">是喔，這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:18:12,103 --> 00:18:16,023
<font color="white">也是啦，要跟批評</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王的教授公開討論</font></font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:18:16,107 --> 00:18:18,484
<font color="white">現在這時間點還是別接為妙</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:18:18,567 --> 00:18:19,819
{\an8}<font color="white">你說的那是…</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:23,114
<font color="white">妳以前是以超人力霸王的粉絲為賣點</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:18:23,948 --> 00:18:26,992
<font color="white">但實際上發生不少事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">已經變得沒那麼喜歡了吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:28,786
<font color="white">我要接</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:18:29,662 --> 00:18:31,038
<font color="white">妳說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:18:31,122 --> 00:18:32,665
<font color="white">我願意接受挑戰</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:18:32,748 --> 00:18:35,751
<font color="white">是喔，這樣啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:18:36,544 --> 00:18:39,713
<font color="white">應該是晚上7點過後吧</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:18:39,797 --> 00:18:41,465
<font color="white">我聽到爆炸聲</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:18:41,549 --> 00:18:44,802
<font color="white">就從床上跳起來</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">擔心得衝出門看看情況</font></font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:18:44,885 --> 00:18:49,140
<font color="white">結果在那期間家裡有東西被偷了</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:18:49,223 --> 00:18:51,350
<font color="white">請問你當時出門多久？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:18:51,433 --> 00:18:54,770
<font color="white">大概二十到三十分鐘吧</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:18:54,854 --> 00:18:56,814
<font color="white">聽說其他人的家也遭小偷</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:18:56,897 --> 00:18:59,733
<font color="white">這棟公寓的住戶</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">幾乎都是竊盜案受害者</font></font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:18:59,817 --> 00:19:02,945
<font color="white">雖然有請警察盡快趕來</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:19:03,028 --> 00:19:04,989
<font color="white">但沒有找到任何線索</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:19:07,074 --> 00:19:08,325
<font color="white">還有注意到其他事情嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:19:12,663 --> 00:19:14,748
<font color="white">正是如此</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:19:15,416 --> 00:19:17,960
<font color="white">我做管理員那麼久</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:19:18,043 --> 00:19:20,087
<font color="white">還是第一次碰到這種事</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:19:22,256 --> 00:19:26,552
<font color="white">另外，不知道是不是那起爆炸案害的</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:19:26,635 --> 00:19:29,221
<font color="white">我們這裡明明有四台監視器</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:19:29,305 --> 00:19:32,308
<font color="white">卻完全沒拍到畫面</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:19:32,391 --> 00:19:34,351
<font color="white">你說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:19:41,942 --> 00:19:43,194
<font color="white">-辛苦了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:48,115
<font color="white">犯案痕跡被抹除</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:19:48,199 --> 00:19:50,492
<font color="white">還同時出現多位被害者</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:19:53,537 --> 00:19:55,789
<font color="white">果然是職業小偷幹的吧</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:19:55,873 --> 00:19:58,667
<font color="white">事情沒那麼單純</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:19:58,751 --> 00:20:00,377
<font color="white">可是…</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:20:00,461 --> 00:20:01,712
<font color="white">不然呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:20:01,795 --> 00:20:05,966
<font color="white">數起職業小偷的偷竊案件</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和超人力霸王引發的事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:20:06,050 --> 00:20:08,093
<font color="white">這兩者的時間點</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">只是碰巧重疊在一起嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:20:08,177 --> 00:20:11,222
<font color="white">那樣一想，確實是很巧沒錯啦</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:20:12,514 --> 00:20:17,561
<font color="white">犯人預先得知會發生那起事件？</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:20:19,271 --> 00:20:21,190
<font color="white">不，怎麼可能</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:20:23,025 --> 00:20:24,944
<font color="white">話說回來，遠藤先生</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:20:25,027 --> 00:20:28,614
<font color="white">只要一牽扯到超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你的腦袋頓時就會特別靈光呢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:20:28,697 --> 00:20:31,200
<font color="white">才沒有，我只是覺得…</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:20:32,534 --> 00:20:35,412
<font color="white">凡事都以超人力霸王失控來結案</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:20:36,622 --> 00:20:38,749
<font color="white">實在叫我難以接受</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:20:39,583 --> 00:20:43,545
<font color="white">那就是刑警的直覺嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:20:43,629 --> 00:20:45,214
<font color="white">-天啊</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你是什麼人？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:20:46,507 --> 00:20:47,841
<font color="white">我嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:20:49,134 --> 00:20:51,887
<font color="white">我是貝姆拉</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:20:51,971 --> 00:20:53,681
<font color="white">和你一樣</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:20:53,764 --> 00:20:57,393
<font color="white">是追尋這起事件真相的人</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:20:57,476 --> 00:21:00,229
<font color="white">這是怎麼一回事啊？遠藤先生</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:03,107
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:21:05,442 --> 00:21:07,778
<font color="white">一直在關注你</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:21:18,247 --> 00:21:19,540
<font color="white">什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:21:20,708 --> 00:21:22,960
<font color="white">當必要之時到來</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:21:23,043 --> 00:21:25,129
<font color="white">我將助你一臂之力</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:21:28,757 --> 00:21:30,884
<font color="white">那傢伙到底是什麼來頭？</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:21:30,968 --> 00:21:34,388
<font color="white">他也很小隻，不會是超人力霸王吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:21:50,738 --> 00:21:53,198
<font color="white">久候多時了</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:21:53,824 --> 00:21:57,703
<font color="white">你這傢伙並不是亞達德</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:21:58,829 --> 00:22:00,247
<font color="white">你是什麼人？</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:22:07,921 --> 00:22:09,715
<font color="white">就是這樣的人</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:22:11,300 --> 00:22:12,760
<font color="white">不好意思啦</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：蔡柏頤</font><font color="white"></font>

